      "observed": "On the EthernetAndPower sheet the FAN53610AUC33X (IC2) buck converter's output inductor between the SW node and the +3V3 output rail is drawn and valued as \"L3  LQM2MPN1R0NGHL\".",
      "expected": "The specification requires the Murata LQM2MPN1R0MGHL (1.0 uH) part, explicitly stating it matches the FAN53610 datasheet Table 2 'Utilized to generate graphs' recommended inductor. LQM2MPN1R0NGHL is a different Murata part number (different tolerance/grade, and hence different rated current/saturation behaviour), i.e. a different inductor than the intended one.",
      "evidence": [
